<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 John</book>
  <para style="h">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 John</para>
  <para style="mt">2 John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khangham pa in, thuman thutah sunga ka it, kei beh hi loin thuman a thei mi zosie in zong a it,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kote sunga a om, le kote tawh ang om zing ding tua thuman thutah ziehin teeltuom upa nu le a tate tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Pasien le Pa’ Tapa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina, khuotuona le lungnopna in thuman thutah le itna tawh eite ei ompi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pa in eite ei thupieh bang lienin thuman thutah sungah na tate pawlkhat a kalsuon uh ka mu ziehin ka kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei aw, tu-in na kungah thupieh tha ang giel dan ka hi sih a, a kipat cil a kipan i neisa uh thupieh pen ma tawh khatlekhat ki-it bo vai ci-a ang thum ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ ei thupiehte banga i zuina pen itna ahi hi; note in a kipat cila na zahsa uh bang lienin itna sungah na kalsuon un, ci thu pen thupieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cilesa sungah Jesu Khris ang pei zo hi, ci thu a sang lo misol tampi, leitungah ang pieng zo ta hi. Tua bang a gen mi poma misol ahi a, anti-khris ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in ka bawlsa uh nate mansuo loin thaman a kimtaha na san thei nadingun na kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khris’ thuhilna-ah kip loin a valkai pei zosie Pasien nei lo ahi hi; a thuhilna-a a kip poma in Pa le Tapa a neiton ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note kungah mi khatpo ang pei-in tami thuhilna ang vom sih leh na hopi sih unlen, na inn vuah zong na tungsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen khum bang mipa hopina pen ama’ gitlo nasepna sunga kihalna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kung vuah giel ding tampi ka nei vangin laitui le laikung zang zaw loin, tua sangin i lungdamna a kicin thei nadingin na kung vuah hing haw-in kimutuo-a i kiho ding ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kiteel na sanggam nu’ tate in note ang noset uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
